{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, Vanessa. Come in.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My informers told me you had a busy evening last night.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You talked to Sally?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I told you that you shouldn't have been so controlling. You must not have heard a word I said yesterday. You could have just let it go, but nooooooo! You had to be an apprehensive little boy who got his feelings hurt.  Ughh! She is the best thing that you've ever had.   You ought to have listened to me. You can't have messed this up!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I don't know if we're broken up or not. I don't think so. She said she was going to call me today and that we'd talk some more.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good. One important difference between Amy and other people is that Amy is very rational and level-headed, thus she is more than willing to let cooler heads prevail.\nUnlike some people I know.  Anyway, you weren't the only one who had an eventful evening.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh. What happened to you?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You know my boss, Bill. Well, he asked me to go to the Maldives all expenses paid.", "time": "38200", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? Wow! That escalated quickly. In contrast to me, Bill moves rather fast. But, isn't this a form of workplace harassment? Couldn't you sue him for all he's worth?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, the important difference is that we would be going together as friends.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, right. You call me naive, but I wouldn't have bought that line. I would have told him to get lost.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, our opinion of Bill differs greatly.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You aren't actually considering this, are you?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know. I might be.  At any rate, you need to take care of Amy and I'll figure out what I'm going to do.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We are worse than reality TV.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Bye.", "time": "76000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about beliefs, opinions, relationships or character traits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express uncertainty about past events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express comparison between two things or events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What do you think about reality shows on TV?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Why do you think some people like reality shows on TV?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "My life is like r